---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Transfer Chick"><div class="container-page py-14"><div class="max-w-3xl"><div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400">About</div><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">The anti-boring t-shirt shop.</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600">Transfer Chick exists for people who like their clothes simple, but their graphics anything but.</p><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6"><div class="font-semibold">Tiny stories</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">Our prints use grids of expressive little characters instead of giant branding.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6"><div class="font-semibold">Easy to wear</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">Plain base colours keep even the weirdest illustration surprisingly wearable.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6"><div class="font-semibold">Small batches</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">We’d rather add a few excellent designs than flood the shop with filler.</p></div></div></div></div></BaseLayout>
